+
+No ballot, sponsorship, law, activation, appointment, spending, Judiciary disposition, case closure, compliance verdict or Founder communication is claimed or performed. No canonical file was changed; this is an additive research record proposed through Act 31. Prior research, the predecessor Centre worktree, all dialogue threads and all rejected or conflicted delivery branches remain preserved unchanged. A voting member, the Executive and the independent reviewer own any decision to adopt R1–R4 or to fix and re-propose the staged code.
